<a name="toc_tc69530"></a><p>&nbsp;</p><div> <table class="tc" width="90%" ><tr><th colspan="4">Test Case CTCP-4359: Verify the elements displayed in inspection card &nbsp;<span style="font-size: 80%;">[Version  : 1]</span></th></tr>
<tr><td width="20%" valign="top"><span class="label">Author:</span></td><td colspan="3">uig84184</td></tr>
<tr><td width="20%" valign="top"><span class="label">Last edit by:</span></td><td colspan="3">uie_32437</td></tr>
<tr><td colspan="4"><span class="label">Summary:</span><br />Navigation to inspection list page </td></tr><tr><td colspan="4"><span class="label">Preconditions:</span><br />User have logged in to Conti + application and landed to home page</td></tr><tr><td><span class="label">#:</span></td><td><span class="label">Step actions:</span></td><td><span class="label">Expected Results:</span></td></tr><tr><td width="5">1</td><td><p>Look for inspection card&nbsp;</p>
</td><td><p>Following elements to be displayed in inspection card :</p>

<p>-Main card count -Total number of inspection event&nbsp;</p>

<p>-To be completed count</p>

<p>-Yellow color flag -number of inspection items with condition &quot;fault&quot; and status &quot;to be completed&quot; -Orange color flag -number of inspection items with condition &quot;poor&quot; and status &quot;to be completed&quot; -Red color flag -number of inspection items with condition &quot; critical&quot; and status &quot;to be completed&quot;</p>

<p>Note :&nbsp;-Green color flag -&nbsp; with condition &quot;good&quot; will not be displayed even with status &quot;to be completed&quot;</p>
</td></tr><tr><td width="20%" valign="top"><span class="label">Execution type:</span></td><td colspan="3">Manual</td></tr>
<tr><td width="20%" valign="top"><span class="label">Estimated exec. duration (min):</span></td><td colspan="3"></td></tr>
<tr><td width="20%" valign="top"><span class="label">Importance:</span></td><td colspan="3">High</td></tr>
<tr><td colspan="4"></td></tr><tr><td > Automation Status:</td><td  colspan = "3" ></td></tr>
<tr><td > Notes:</td><td  colspan = "3" ></td></tr>
<tr><td > Review Comments:</td><td  colspan = "3" ></td></tr>
<tr><td width="20%" valign="top"><span class="label">Requirements</span><td colspan="3">&nbsp;None<br /></td></tr>
<tr><td width="20%" valign="top"><span class="label">Keywords:</span></td><td colspan="3">Regression<br /></td></tr>
</table>
