<a name="toc_tc69533"></a><p>&nbsp;</p><div> <table class="tc" width="90%" ><tr><th colspan="4">Test Case CTCP-4360: Verify the logic to display count in inspection card at home level &nbsp;<span style="font-size: 80%;">[Version  : 1]</span></th></tr>
<tr><td width="20%" valign="top"><span class="label">Author:</span></td><td colspan="3">uig84184</td></tr>
<tr><td width="20%" valign="top"><span class="label">Last edit by:</span></td><td colspan="3">uie_32437</td></tr>
<tr><td colspan="4"><span class="label">Summary:</span><br />Verify the logic to display count in inspection card at home level </td></tr><tr><td colspan="4"><span class="label">Preconditions:</span><br />User have logged in to Conti + application and landed to home page

Add inspection data in Site S1 and Conveyor A1, A2, A3 & A4</td></tr><tr><td><span class="label">#:</span></td><td><span class="label">Step actions:</span></td><td><span class="label">Expected Results:</span></td></tr><tr><td width="5">1</td><td><p>Look for inspection card&nbsp;</p>
</td><td><p>Inspection card will display existing count e.g. : Event count -100 To be completed -40 with&nbsp;Yellow, Orange &amp; Red - 10 count each</p>
</td></tr><tr><td width="5">2</td><td><p>Now add inspection event with status as&nbsp; completed and condition Green for conveyor A1</p>
</td><td><p>After adding the inspection event home card count will be : Event count -101 To be completed -40&nbsp;with Yellow-10, Orange-10 &amp; Red - 10</p>
</td></tr><tr><td width="5">3</td><td><p>Now add inspection event with status as To be completed and condition fault for A2</p>
</td><td><p>After adding the inspection event home card count will be : Event count -102 To be completed -41&nbsp;with Yellow-11, Orange-10 &amp; Red - 10</p>
</td></tr><tr><td width="5">5</td><td><p>Now add inspection event with status as To be completed and condition Orange for conveyor A3</p>
</td><td><p>After adding the inspection event home card count will be : Event count -103 To be completed -42 with Yellow-11, Orange-11 &amp; Red - 10</p>
</td></tr><tr><td width="5">6</td><td><p>Now add inspection event with status as To be completed and condition Red for conveyor A4</p>
</td><td><p>After adding the inspection event home card count will be : Event count -104 To be completed -43&nbsp;with Yellow-11, Orange-11 &amp; Red - 11</p>
</td></tr><tr><td width="20%" valign="top"><span class="label">Execution type:</span></td><td colspan="3">Manual</td></tr>
<tr><td width="20%" valign="top"><span class="label">Estimated exec. duration (min):</span></td><td colspan="3"></td></tr>
<tr><td width="20%" valign="top"><span class="label">Importance:</span></td><td colspan="3">High</td></tr>
<tr><td colspan="4"></td></tr><tr><td > Automation Status:</td><td  colspan = "3" ></td></tr>
<tr><td > Notes:</td><td  colspan = "3" ></td></tr>
<tr><td > Review Comments:</td><td  colspan = "3" ></td></tr>
<tr><td width="20%" valign="top"><span class="label">Requirements</span><td colspan="3">&nbsp;None<br /></td></tr>
<tr><td width="20%" valign="top"><span class="label">Keywords:</span></td><td colspan="3">Regression<br /></td></tr>
</table>
</div>
