<a name="toc_tc69574"></a><p>&nbsp;</p><div> <table class="tc" width="90%" ><tr><th colspan="4">Test Case CTCP-4366: Verify inspection logo behavior in case inspection is done by distributor corporate&nbsp;<span style="font-size: 80%;">[Version  : 1]</span></th></tr>
<tr><td width="20%" valign="top"><span class="label">Author:</span></td><td colspan="3">uie_32437</td></tr>
<tr><td colspan="4"><span class="label">Summary:</span><br /><p>Verify inspection logo behavior in case inspection is done by distributor corporate&nbsp;</p>
</td></tr><tr><td colspan="4"><span class="label">Preconditions:</span><br /><p>Considering Dist user A belongs to Dist corporate DC, Dist corp&nbsp;having profile image.&nbsp;</p>

<p>Login with user A in mobile and two inspection event&nbsp;:</p>

<p>Inspection 1 - Don&#39;t add any inspection logo</p>

<p>Inspection 2 - Add insepction logo</p>
</td></tr><tr><td><span class="label">#:</span></td><td><span class="label">Step actions:</span></td><td><span class="label">Expected Results:</span></td></tr><tr><td width="5">1</td><td><p>Login to mobile application with Dist user A</p>
</td><td><p>User should be able to login&nbsp;</p>
</td></tr><tr><td width="5">2</td><td><p>Donwnload inspection report of inspection 1&nbsp;</p>
</td><td><p>Dist corporate logo to which Dist user belongs will be dispalyed in pdf report in left hand side. If distributor corporate logo and custom inspection logog added by dist user is not there then conti logo&nbsp;will be dispalyed in pdf report</p>
</td></tr><tr><td width="5">3</td><td><p>Donwload inspection 2&nbsp;</p>
</td><td><p>Observe in pdf report custome added dist logo which creating the inspection will be dispalyed&nbsp;</p>
</td></tr><tr><td width="20%" valign="top"><span class="label">Execution type:</span></td><td colspan="3">Manual</td></tr>
<tr><td width="20%" valign="top"><span class="label">Estimated exec. duration (min):</span></td><td colspan="3"></td></tr>
<tr><td width="20%" valign="top"><span class="label">Importance:</span></td><td colspan="3">Medium</td></tr>
<tr><td colspan="4"></td></tr><tr><td > Automation Status:</td><td  colspan = "3" >To Be Analysed</td></tr>
<tr><td > Notes:</td><td  colspan = "3" ></td></tr>
<tr><td > Review Comments:</td><td  colspan = "3" ></td></tr>
<tr><td width="20%" valign="top"><span class="label">Requirements</span><td colspan="3">CTCP-11119:  Inspections - Mobile [Version : 1]<br /></td></tr>
<tr><td width="20%" valign="top"><span class="label">Keywords:</span></td><td colspan="3">Regression<br /></td></tr>
</table>
</div>
<a name="toc_tc79353"></a><p>&nbsp;</p><div> <table class="tc" width="90%" ><tr><th colspan="4">Test Case CTCP-4643: Verify good condition flag functionality with status field&nbsp;<span style="font-size: 80%;">[Version  : 1]</span></th></tr>
<tr><td width="20%" valign="top"><span class="label">Author:</span></td><td colspan="3">uie_32437</td></tr>
<tr><td colspan="4"><span class="label">Summary:</span><br /><p>Verify good condition flag functionality with status field&nbsp;</p>
</td></tr><tr><td colspan="4"><span class="label">Preconditions:</span><br /><p>User is on inspection list screen&nbsp;</p>
</td></tr><tr><td><span class="label">#:</span></td><td><span class="label">Step actions:</span></td><td><span class="label">Expected Results:</span></td></tr><tr><td width="5">1</td><td><p>Click on + button to add insepction event from home level&nbsp;</p>
</td><td><p>While adding in step 3 conveyor name should be default blank and user should able to select the conveyor from dropdown&nbsp;</p>
</td></tr><tr><td width="5">2</td><td><p>Add inspection item with condition as Good&nbsp;</p>
</td><td><p>User shoudl abel to add inspection item with good condition&nbsp;</p>
</td></tr><tr><td width="5">3</td><td><p>Look for status field&nbsp;</p>
</td><td><p>Completed should be selected as Status, Observe To be completed status radio button should be disabled&nbsp;</p>
</td></tr><tr><td width="5">4</td><td><p>Save the item&nbsp;</p>
</td><td><p>User should able to save the item&nbsp;</p>
</td></tr><tr><td width="5">5</td><td><p>Edit the same inspection item&nbsp;</p>
</td><td><p>User shoudl abel to edit&nbsp;</p>
</td></tr><tr><td width="5">6</td><td><p>Now change the condition to critical&nbsp;</p>
</td><td><p>Observe user is able to change the status to To be completed &amp; save the item&nbsp;</p>
</td></tr><tr><td width="5">7</td><td><p>Verify above test case for vulcan and default&nbsp;</p>
</td><td><p>Above test case applicable for both vulcan and default&nbsp;</p>
</td></tr><tr><td width="20%" valign="top"><span class="label">Execution type:</span></td><td colspan="3">Manual</td></tr>
<tr><td width="20%" valign="top"><span class="label">Estimated exec. duration (min):</span></td><td colspan="3"></td></tr>
<tr><td width="20%" valign="top"><span class="label">Importance:</span></td><td colspan="3">High</td></tr>
<tr><td colspan="4"></td></tr><tr><td > Automation Status:</td><td  colspan = "3" >To Be Analysed</td></tr>
<tr><td > Notes:</td><td  colspan = "3" ></td></tr>
<tr><td > Review Comments:</td><td  colspan = "3" ></td></tr>
<tr><td width="20%" valign="top"><span class="label">Requirements</span><td colspan="3">CTCP-13996:  CR : Inspection Add Items -web [Version : 1]<br />CTCP-13995:  CR: Add Inspection item - Mobile [Version : 1]<br /></td></tr>
<tr><td width="20%" valign="top"><span class="label">Keywords:</span></td><td colspan="3">Regression<br /></td></tr>
</table>
