<a name="toc_tc70301"></a><p>&nbsp;</p><div> <table class="tc" width="90%" ><tr><th colspan="4">Test Case CTCP-4425: Verify the item sequence logic for Vulcan template&nbsp;<span style="font-size: 80%;">[Version  : 1]</span></th></tr>
<tr><td width="20%" valign="top"><span class="label">Author:</span></td><td colspan="3">uig84184</td></tr>
<tr><td width="20%" valign="top"><span class="label">Last edit by:</span></td><td colspan="3">uie_32437</td></tr>
<tr><td colspan="4"><span class="label">Summary:</span><br />Verify the item sequence logic for Vulcan template </td></tr><tr><td colspan="4"><span class="label">Preconditions:</span><br />Following data should be created for inspection 
1. Corporate CV1
2. Site S1
3. Conveyor CV1, CV2
4. Inspection event- Multi inspect 
5. Item with conveyor CV1
Item1.1 -To be completed, Good 
Item1.2 -To be completed, Critical 
Item1.3 -To be completed, Fault 
Item1.4 -To be completed, Poor 
6. Item with conveyor CV2
Item2.1 -Completed, Good 
Item2.2 -Completed, Critical 
Item2.3 -To be completed, Fault 
Item2.4 -To be completed, Poor </td></tr><tr><td><span class="label">#:</span></td><td><span class="label">Step actions:</span></td><td><span class="label">Expected Results:</span></td></tr><tr><td width="5">1</td><td> Navigate to view mode of above added item </td><td>User should able to navigate to inspection details page</td></tr><tr><td width="5">2</td><td>Click on edit button in top</td><td>User should land to inspection event edit page </td></tr><tr><td width="5">3</td><td>Update the inspection name with suffix edit </td><td>User should able to update inspection name </td></tr><tr><td width="5">4</td><td>Verify site name should be in disable form</td><td>User can not edit site name </td></tr><tr><td width="5">5</td><td>Look for condition and status count </td><td>Following Data should display : 
1. Conveyor name CV1 & CV2
2. Critical Data with Completed and To be completed count 
3. Poor Data with Completed and To be completed count 
4. fault Data with Completed and To be completed count 
5. Good Data with Completed and To be completed count 
The count should in table should match with inspection event details count
</td></tr><tr><td width="5">6</td><td>Verify Conveyor name , Asset & details filed is not editable</td><td>User should not able to edit conveyor name , asset & details field</td></tr><tr><td width="5">7</td><td>Look for the item order sequence in view mode </td><td>Following item order should display :
1st data should arranged as per conveyor 
Then data should arrange as per condition 
Then in case condition is same then asset sequence order will consider </td></tr><tr><td width="5">8</td><td>Change the item 1.1 condition from Good to fault  and status from To be completed to completed</td><td>User should able to update the condition of item </td></tr><tr><td width="5">9</td><td>Save the changes </td><td>User should able to save the changes </td></tr><tr><td width="5">10</td><td>Look for order sequence </td><td>Updated order sequence should display : 
1st data should arranged as per conveyor 
Then data should arrange as per condition 
Then in case condition is same then asset sequence order will consider </td></tr><tr><td width="5">11</td><td>Navigate to inspection event list page </td><td>Updated multi conveyor inspect event should be displayed </td></tr><tr><td width="5">12</td><td>Look for the Data conveyor </td><td>2 should be displayed in conveyor label </td></tr><tr><td width="5">13</td><td>Look for  Condition</td><td>Updated condition flag count should display </td></tr><tr><td width="5">14</td><td>Look for  Status </td><td>Updated status count should display </td></tr><tr><td width="5">15</td><td>Look for inspection name  </td><td>Updated inspection event  name should be displayed in list</td></tr><tr><td width="20%" valign="top"><span class="label">Execution type:</span></td><td colspan="3">Manual</td></tr>
<tr><td width="20%" valign="top"><span class="label">Estimated exec. duration (min):</span></td><td colspan="3"></td></tr>
<tr><td width="20%" valign="top"><span class="label">Importance:</span></td><td colspan="3">High</td></tr>
<tr><td colspan="4"></td></tr><tr><td > Automation Status:</td><td  colspan = "3" ></td></tr>
<tr><td > Notes:</td><td  colspan = "3" ></td></tr>
<tr><td > Review Comments:</td><td  colspan = "3" ></td></tr>
