<a name="toc_tc86838"></a><p>&nbsp;</p><div> <table class="tc" width="90%" ><tr><th colspan="4">Test Case CTCP-4760: Verify single conveyor add inspection functionality1&nbsp;<span style="font-size: 80%;">[Version  : 1]</span></th></tr>
<tr><td width="20%" valign="top"><span class="label">Author:</span></td><td colspan="3">uie_32437</td></tr>
<tr><td colspan="4"><span class="label">Summary:</span><br /><p>Verify single conveyor add inspection functionality</p>
</td></tr><tr><td colspan="4"><span class="label">Preconditions:</span><br /><p>User is on inspection list page</p>
</td></tr><tr><td><span class="label">#:</span></td><td><span class="label">Step actions:</span></td><td><span class="label">Expected Results:</span></td></tr><tr><td width="5">1</td><td>Click on + button </td><td>User lands to add inspection page </td></tr><tr><td width="5">2</td><td><p>Observe the heading displayed in top</p>
</td><td><p>Add inspection Event should be displayed in top</p>
</td></tr><tr><td width="5">4</td><td><p>Look for the fields displayed&nbsp;</p>
</td><td><p>Following fields in sequence should be displayed where * is for mandatory field :</p>

<p>Site Name&nbsp;</p>

<p>Inspection date&nbsp;</p>

<p>Inspection Name&nbsp;</p>

<p>Inspector Name&nbsp;</p>

<p>Inspection template - showing Vulcan as disable value&nbsp;</p>

<p>Next and Cancel button&nbsp;</p>
</td></tr><tr><td width="5">5</td><td><p>Look for inspection template</p>
</td><td><p>Vulcan template in disabled for should be displayed as template</p>
</td></tr><tr><td width="5">6</td><td>Look for inspection date </td><td>Current date should be displayed as inspection date or user can select the date manually </td></tr><tr><td width="5">7</td><td>Look for inspection name  </td><td>As user select site name, inspection name will be automatically created as Current date + Site name </td></tr><tr><td width="5">8</td><td>Look for Inspector name </td><td>Current logged in user adding the inspection data name should be displayed </td></tr><tr><td width="5">9</td><td>Look for map </td><td>Map should display Site Conveyor name and head and tail position of the conveyor linked 
IN case head and tail are not defined load site location </td></tr><tr><td width="5">10</td><td>Look for mandatory fields </td><td>Site name, date, Inspection Name and Inspector name should be displayed as mandatory field </td></tr><tr><td width="5">11</td><td><p>Click on next button&nbsp;</p>
</td><td><p>As user click on next button inspection event will be created even though user dont add inspection inspection items in event&nbsp;</p>
</td></tr><tr><td width="5">12</td><td><p>Look for the heading of the page&nbsp;</p>
</td><td><p>User will redirect to Edit inspection event page&nbsp;</p>
</td></tr><tr><td width="5">13</td><td><p>Look for the fields displayed in edit inspection event page&nbsp;</p>
</td><td><p>Following fields should be displayed :&nbsp;</p>

<p>Inspection Event details section which opens when click on epand button&nbsp;</p>

<p>Inspection item section&nbsp;</p>

<p>Summary&nbsp;</p>

<p>Save and cancel button&nbsp;</p>
</td></tr><tr><td width="5">14</td><td>Look for select conveyor dropdown </td><td>All linked conveyor only with above selected site should display in dropdown </td></tr><tr><td width="5">15</td><td><p>Verify asset sequence</p>
</td><td><p>Asset sequence should be same as as displayed for vulcan inspection in confluence, link : https://confluence.auto.continental.cloud/display/projectCTCP/3.+Templates+-+Inspections</p>
</td></tr><tr><td width="5">18</td><td><p>Click on create and cancel button on add Iterm page&nbsp;</p>
</td><td><p>On click create button item will be added and user redirect again to Edit inspection event page&nbsp;</p>

<p>If user click on cancel&nbsp;user redirect again to Edit inspection event page&nbsp;</p>
</td></tr><tr><td width="5">19</td><td><p>Look for details displayed in case user added&nbsp; item</p>
</td><td><p>Post adding the item, Added item will be highlighted with light yellow color with flag consition, Status icon(complted or To be complted tick icon) &amp; Delete icon.</p>

<p>&nbsp;</p>
</td></tr><tr><td width="5">20</td><td><p>Click on Save and cancel button post adding items&nbsp;</p>
</td><td><p>If user click on Save button then item will be created and user will redirect to List page&nbsp;</p>

<p>If user click on Cancel button then waring pop-up should display as inspection item is not saved&nbsp;</p>
</td></tr><tr><td width="5">23</td><td>Observe the status of the inspection event in list </td><td>The status of the added item in list should change from upload pending to uploaded </td></tr><tr><td width="20%" valign="top"><span class="label">Execution type:</span></td><td colspan="3">Manual</td></tr>
<tr><td width="20%" valign="top"><span class="label">Estimated exec. duration (min):</span></td><td colspan="3"></td></tr>
<tr><td width="20%" valign="top"><span class="label">Importance:</span></td><td colspan="3">High</td></tr>
<tr><td colspan="4"></td></tr><tr><td > Automation Status:</td><td  colspan = "3" >To Be Analysed</td></tr>
<tr><td > Notes:</td><td  colspan = "3" ></td></tr>
<tr><td > Review Comments:</td><td  colspan = "3" ></td></tr>
<tr><td width="20%" valign="top"><span class="label">Requirements</span><td colspan="3">&nbsp;None<br /></td></tr>
<tr><td width="20%" valign="top"><span class="label">Keywords:</span></td><td colspan="3">&nbsp;None<br/></td></tr>
</table>
</div>
