<a name="toc_tc69901"></a><p>&nbsp;</p><div> <table class="tc" width="90%" ><tr><th colspan="4">Test Case CTCP-4379: Verify the filter functionality displayed in header&nbsp;<span style="font-size: 80%;">[Version  : 1]</span></th></tr>
