<tr><td colspan="4"><span class="label">Summary:</span><br />Verify the functionality for inspection date column </td></tr><tr><td colspan="4"><span class="label">Preconditions:</span><br />User is on inspection list page </td></tr><tr><td><span class="label">#:</span></td><td><span class="label">Step actions:</span></td><td><span class="label">Expected Results:</span></td></tr><tr><td width="5">1</td><td>Look for filter icon displayed in header</td><td>Filter icon should display </td></tr><tr><td width="5">2</td><td><p>Click on filter icon</p>
</td><td><p>On click following option should display : Sort By : Last modified, A-Z, Z-A, Uploaded, Upload Pending&nbsp;</p>
</td></tr><tr><td width="5">3</td><td>Verify filter </td><td>User can apply any date filter via calendar  </td></tr><tr><td width="5">4</td><td>Verify by default sorting of inspection event </td><td>By default sorting of inspection item should be on last modified date </td></tr><tr><td width="5">5</td><td>Verify A-Z sorting filter </td><td>ON selecting A-Z sorting inspection event should be sort alphabetically from A-Z</td></tr><tr><td width="5">6</td><td>Verify Z-A sorting filter </td><td>ON selecting Z-A sorting inspection event should be sort alphabetically from Z-A</td></tr><tr><td width="5">7</td><td><p>Select Uploaded radio button</p>
</td><td><p>Event date should display only uploaded inspection not&nbsp; uploading inspection event</p>
</td></tr><tr><td width="5">9</td><td>Select Uploading radio button</td><td>Event date should display only Uploading inspection not Draft and Uploaded inspection event </td></tr><tr><td width="5">10</td><td>Verify customer corporate filter</td><td>By selecting customer corporate, only selected customer corporates inspection event should display </td></tr><tr><td width="5">11</td><td>Select site filter only</td><td>In case user select only site filter then only selected conveyor related inspection events should display </td></tr><tr><td width="5">12</td><td>Select conveyor filter only </td><td>In case user select only conveyor filter then only selected conveyor related inspection events should display </td></tr><tr><td width="5">13</td><td>Select condition filter only </td><td>In case user select only condition filter then only selected condition related inspection events should display </td></tr><tr><td width="5">14</td><td>Select status filter only </td><td>In case user select only status filter then only selected status related inspection events should display </td></tr><tr><td width="5">15</td><td>Verify the field type </td><td>Site is mandatory field </td></tr><tr><td width="20%" valign="top"><span class="label">Execution type:</span></td><td colspan="3">Manual</td></tr>
<tr><td width="20%" valign="top"><span class="label">Estimated exec. duration (min):</span></td><td colspan="3"></td></tr>
