<a name="toc_tc70117"></a><p>&nbsp;</p><div> <table class="tc" width="90%" ><tr><th colspan="4">Test Case CTCP-4403: Verify only to be completed inspection will be displayed in inspection event condition flag column&nbsp;<span style="font-size: 80%;">[Version  : 1]</span></th></tr>
<tr><td width="20%" valign="top"><span class="label">Author:</span></td><td colspan="3">uig84184</td></tr>
<tr><td width="20%" valign="top"><span class="label">Last edit by:</span></td><td colspan="3">uie_32437</td></tr>
<tr><td colspan="4"><span class="label">Summary:</span><br />Verify only to be completed inspection will be displayed in inspection event condition flag column</td></tr><tr><td colspan="4"><span class="label">Preconditions:</span><br /> Considering Site S1 having conveyor Cv1, CV2 & Cv3 with above inspection event precondition </td></tr><tr><td><span class="label">#:</span></td><td><span class="label">Step actions:</span></td><td><span class="label">Expected Results:</span></td></tr><tr><td width="5">1</td><td>Add inspection event as :
Item 1 : Status To be completed and Flag critical
Item 2 : Status To be completed ad flag fault 
Item 3 : Status Completed and Flag Good </td><td>User should able to create the event </td></tr><tr><td width="5">2</td><td>Now navigate to inspection event list and observe the condition flag column for above added event</td><td>The condition column should display only two flags :
-Critical and Fault 
Good flag should not display as its status is Completed </td></tr><tr><td width="5">3</td><td>Now edit the inspection item :
Item 1 : Keep as it is 
Item 2 : Change Status from To be completed to completed and flag fault 
Item 3 : Change Status from completed to To be Completed and Flag Good </td><td>User should able to update the conditions and status </td></tr><tr><td width="5">4</td><td>Now save the changes </td><td>User should able to save the changes </td></tr><tr><td width="5">5</td><td>Now navigate to inspection event list and observe the condition flag column for above added event</td><td>The condition column should display only two flags :
-Critical and Good 
Fault flag should not display as its status is Completed </td></tr><tr><td width="5">6</td><td>Expand the inspection event</td><td>Critical, Good & Fault all flags should be displayed on expand</td></tr><tr><td width="20%" valign="top"><span class="label">Execution type:</span></td><td colspan="3">Manual</td></tr>
<tr><td width="20%" valign="top"><span class="label">Estimated exec. duration (min):</span></td><td colspan="3"></td></tr>
<tr><td width="20%" valign="top"><span class="label">Importance:</span></td><td colspan="3">High</td></tr>
