<tr><td colspan="4"><span class="label">Summary:</span><br />Verify after addign the inspection details should displayed on conveyor list screen </td></tr><tr><td colspan="4"><span class="label">Preconditions:</span><br />Two conveyor already having inspection item mapped to it, one inspection event all items are in To be completed state & in other conveyor all items are in completed state </td></tr><tr><td><span class="label">#:</span></td><td><span class="label">Step actions:</span></td><td><span class="label">Expected Results:</span></td></tr><tr><td width="5">1</td><td>Navigate to conveyor list screen </td><td>User should able to navigate </td></tr><tr><td width="5">2</td><td>Click on conveyor card </td><td>User should land to conveyor list screen </td></tr><tr><td width="5">3</td><td>Now observe the inspection data reflect in conveyor list</td><td>If conveyor have inspection and any of the item is in To be completed state then triangle icon with count should show or if all inspection item are in completed state then tick option should display </td></tr><tr><td width="20%" valign="top"><span class="label">Execution type:</span></td><td colspan="3">Manual</td></tr>
<tr><td width="20%" valign="top"><span class="label">Estimated exec. duration (min):</span></td><td colspan="3"></td></tr>
<tr><td width="20%" valign="top"><span class="label">Importance:</span></td><td colspan="3">Medium</td></tr>
