<a name="toc_tc76537"></a><p>&nbsp;</p><div> <table class="tc" width="90%" ><tr><th colspan="4">Test Case CTCP-4566: Verify download pdf report in case inspection report is of large size&nbsp;<span style="font-size: 80%;">[Version  : 1]</span></th></tr>
<tr><td width="20%" valign="top"><span class="label">Author:</span></td><td colspan="3">uie_32437</td></tr>
<tr><td colspan="4"><span class="label">Summary:</span><br /><p>Verify download pdf report in case inspection report is of large size&nbsp;</p>
</td></tr><tr><td colspan="4"><span class="label">Preconditions:</span><br /><p>Inspection event with 100 items with each item having 3 images linked to each item exist</p>
</td></tr><tr><td><span class="label">#:</span></td><td><span class="label">Step actions:</span></td><td><span class="label">Expected Results:</span></td></tr><tr><td width="5">1</td><td><p>Login in mobile with expected user&nbsp;</p>
</td><td><p>User should be able to login&nbsp;</p>
</td></tr><tr><td width="5">2</td><td><p>Now download the event report having 100 items&nbsp;</p>
</td><td><p>Observe alert message should display :</p>

<p>&quot;The inspection pdf is exceeding the supported file size. Please use Conti+ 2.0 web application to generate the report&quot; with Ok button&nbsp;</p>
</td></tr><tr><td width="5">3</td><td><p>If user click on Ok button</p>
</td><td><p>User should redirect to existing page&nbsp;</p>
</td></tr><tr><td width="20%" valign="top"><span class="label">Execution type:</span></td><td colspan="3">Manual</td></tr>
