</td><td><p>User will navigate to conveyor details screen&nbsp;</p>
</td></tr><tr><td width="5">3</td><td><p>Click on inspection card&nbsp;</p>
</td><td><p>User will navigate to inspection list screen</p>
</td></tr><tr><td width="5">4</td><td><p>Click on + button to add inspection&nbsp;</p>
</td><td><p>Add inspection page should display&nbsp;</p>
