</td><td><p>Following value should be prefilled :</p>

<p>Site name&nbsp;</p>

<p>Inspection template type&nbsp;</p>

<p>INspection date as current date&nbsp;</p>

<p>Inspection name : Site name + current date&nbsp;</p>

<p>Inspector name&nbsp;</p>

<p>Site location with user gps location if enabled in mobile as per permission&nbsp;</p>
</td></tr><tr><td width="20%" valign="top"><span class="label">Execution type:</span></td><td colspan="3">Manual</td></tr>
