<a name="toc_tc86860"></a><p>&nbsp;</p><div> <table class="tc" width="90%" ><tr><th colspan="4">Test Case CTCP-4761: Verify Load button functionality for vulcan inspection template with no previous inspection item&nbsp;<span style="font-size: 80%;">[Version  : 1]</span></th></tr>
<tr><td width="20%" valign="top"><span class="label">Author:</span></td><td colspan="3">uie_32437</td></tr>
<tr><td colspan="4"><span class="label">Summary:</span><br /><p>Verify Load button functionality for vulcan inspection template with no previous inspection item&nbsp;</p>
</td></tr><tr><td colspan="4"><span class="label">Preconditions:</span><br /><p>User should be on Add inspection event page and no previous inspection item mapped to the selected conveyor&nbsp;</p>
</td></tr><tr><td><span class="label">#:</span></td><td><span class="label">Step actions:</span></td><td><span class="label">Expected Results:</span></td></tr><tr><td width="5">1</td><td><p>User is on Add inspection event page with event level details filled&nbsp;</p>
</td><td><p>User should able to navigate&nbsp;</p>
</td></tr><tr><td width="5">2</td><td><p>Now without selecting conveyor observe Inspection load button&nbsp;</p>
</td><td><p>Without selecting conveyor inspection load button should be displayed in disabled form&nbsp;</p>
</td></tr><tr><td width="5">3</td><td><p>Now select the conveyor and observe Load open inspection item button&nbsp;</p>
</td><td><p>Post selecting the conveyor Load open inspection item button should be displayed in enabled form&nbsp;</p>
</td></tr><tr><td width="5">4</td><td><p>Now click on load inspection item button&nbsp;</p>
</td><td><p>Since no open previous inspection item exist with the conveyor hence Information Pop-up will be displayed with message : No previous inspection item in To be completed status found with Back button&nbsp;</p>
</td></tr><tr><td width="20%" valign="top"><span class="label">Execution type:</span></td><td colspan="3">Manual</td></tr>
<tr><td width="20%" valign="top"><span class="label">Estimated exec. duration (min):</span></td><td colspan="3"></td></tr>
<tr><td width="20%" valign="top"><span class="label">Importance:</span></td><td colspan="3">High</td></tr>
<tr><td colspan="4"></td></tr><tr><td > Automation Status:</td><td  colspan = "3" >To Be Analysed</td></tr>
