<a name="toc_tc86866"></a><p>&nbsp;</p><div> <table class="tc" width="90%" ><tr><th colspan="4">Test Case CTCP-4762: Verify Load open inspection item button  in case previous inspection item link to conveyor exist&nbsp;<span style="font-size: 80%;">[Version  : 1]</span></th></tr>
<tr><td width="20%" valign="top"><span class="label">Author:</span></td><td colspan="3">uie_32437</td></tr>
<tr><td colspan="4"><span class="label">Summary:</span><br /><p>Verify Load open inspection item button fucntionality in case previous inspection item link to conveyor exist&nbsp;</p>
</td></tr><tr><td colspan="4"><span class="label">Preconditions:</span><br /><p>The conveyor should contain previous isnpection item linked&nbsp;</p>
</td></tr><tr><td><span class="label">#:</span></td><td><span class="label">Step actions:</span></td><td><span class="label">Expected Results:</span></td></tr><tr><td width="5">1</td><td><p>User is on Edit inspection event page&nbsp;</p>
</td><td><p>user should able to navigate</p>
</td></tr><tr><td width="5">2</td><td><p>On add inspection item section select conveyor having old inspection item mapped to it&nbsp;</p>
</td><td><p>User should able to select the conveyor&nbsp;</p>
</td></tr><tr><td width="5">3</td><td><p>Click on Load open inspection item button&nbsp;</p>
</td><td><p>Confirmation pop-up should display with message :&nbsp;</p>

<p>Are you sure you want to load Inspection Items from the previous Inspection Event with the status &quot;to be completed&quot; for this selection? Please review the latest sync timestamp before proceeding.</p>

<p>Inspection Name : Previous inspection open item event name&nbsp;</p>

<p>Inspection date : Previous inspection open item event date&nbsp;</p>

<p>Conveyor Name&nbsp;</p>

<p>Sync time when inspection list was loaded and synced</p>

<p>No and Yes Button (If user click on No then user will land to Edit&nbsp; inspection event page only, If user click on Yes then previous inspection To be completed item should laod which is linked to current conveyor )</p>

<p>&nbsp;</p>

<p>&nbsp;</p>
</td></tr><tr><td width="5">4</td><td><p>Now click on yes button&nbsp;</p>
</td><td><p>Previous inspection item will load with there respective condition and staus&nbsp;</p>
</td></tr><tr><td width="5">5</td><td><p>Click any of the previous inspection item and look for image attached&nbsp;</p>
</td><td><p>The previous item image should be dispalyed&nbsp;</p>
</td></tr><tr><td width="5">6</td><td><p>Now make changes and add one more inspection item&nbsp;</p>
</td><td><p>User should able to make changes and save it&nbsp;</p>
</td></tr><tr><td width="5">7</td><td><p>Now verify inspection event should get save and reflect as expected in PDF report</p>
</td><td><p>The changes are reflecting as expected.</p>
</td></tr><tr><td width="20%" valign="top"><span class="label">Execution type:</span></td><td colspan="3">Manual</td></tr>
<tr><td width="20%" valign="top"><span class="label">Estimated exec. duration (min):</span></td><td colspan="3"></td></tr>
<tr><td width="20%" valign="top"><span class="label">Importance:</span></td><td colspan="3">High</td></tr>
<tr><td colspan="4"></td></tr><tr><td > Automation Status:</td><td  colspan = "3" >To Be Analysed</td></tr>
<tr><td > Notes:</td><td  colspan = "3" ></td></tr>
<tr><td > Review Comments:</td><td  colspan = "3" ></td></tr>
<tr><td width="20%" valign="top"><span class="label">Requirements</span><td colspan="3">&nbsp;None<br /></td></tr>
<tr><td width="20%" valign="top"><span class="label">Keywords:</span></td><td colspan="3">Regression<br /></td></tr>
</table>
