</div><a name="toc_tc76554"></a><p>&nbsp;</p><div> <table class="tc" width="90%" ><tr><th colspan="4">Test Case CTCP-4568: Verify inspection map condition in case conveyor is not having any location&nbsp;<span style="font-size: 80%;">[Version  : 1]</span></th></tr>
