<tr><td width="20%" valign="top"><span class="label">Last edit by:</span></td><td colspan="3">uie_32437</td></tr>
<tr><td colspan="4"><span class="label">Summary:</span><br />Verify inspection map condition in case conveyor is not having any location </td></tr><tr><td colspan="4"><span class="label">Preconditions:</span><br />Considering site S1 is created with location. Conveyor C1 without head and tail position is mapped to Site S1. User is adding inspection to conveyor C1. Location permission is on</td></tr><tr><td><span class="label">#:</span></td><td><span class="label">Step actions:</span></td><td><span class="label">Expected Results:</span></td></tr><tr><td width="5">1</td><td>User is on add inspection info screen </td><td>On inspection info screen site map location should display</td></tr><tr><td width="5">2</td><td>Add item in event </td><td>User should able to add item </td></tr><tr><td width="5">3</td><td>Look for map load in item screen</td><td>Current location of user should load in item map </td></tr><tr><td width="5">4</td><td>Click on map section</td><td>Map should open in full screen mode </td></tr><tr><td width="5">5</td><td>Look for direction indicator </td><td>Direction indicator should display in full screen mode </td></tr><tr><td width="5">6</td><td>Save the item</td><td>User should able to save the item </td></tr><tr><td width="5">7</td><td>Save the event </td><td>User should able to save the event </td></tr><tr><td width="5">8</td><td>Now navigate to view mode of same inspection event </td><td>In view mode on inspection info screen site location should display & on item list screen map should display user pin location </td></tr><tr><td width="5">9</td><td>Now navigate to edit mode of same inspection event </td><td>User should able to edit the inspection event </td></tr><tr><td width="5">10</td><td>Now navigate to edit mode of same inspection event </td><td>In edit mode also same location should display which user have added and displayed in view mode </td></tr><tr><td width="20%" valign="top"><span class="label">Execution type:</span></td><td colspan="3">Manual</td></tr>
<tr><td width="20%" valign="top"><span class="label">Estimated exec. duration (min):</span></td><td colspan="3"></td></tr>
<tr><td width="20%" valign="top"><span class="label">Importance:</span></td><td colspan="3">High</td></tr>
<tr><td colspan="4"></td></tr><tr><td > Automation Status:</td><td  colspan = "3" ></td></tr>
<tr><td > Notes:</td><td  colspan = "3" ></td></tr>
<tr><td > Review Comments:</td><td  colspan = "3" ></td></tr>
<tr><td width="20%" valign="top"><span class="label">Requirements</span><td colspan="3">CTCP-13538:  Inspection Site Map changes [Version : 1]<br /></td></tr>
