<tr><td colspan="4"><span class="label">Summary:</span><br />Verify inspection map functionality in case user device location is off</td></tr><tr><td colspan="4"><span class="label">Preconditions:</span><br />Considering site S1 is created with location. Conveyor C1 has head and tail position & is mapped to Site S1. User is adding inspection to conveyor C1. Location permission of device is off.</td></tr><tr><td><span class="label">#:</span></td><td><span class="label">Step actions:</span></td><td><span class="label">Expected Results:</span></td></tr><tr><td width="5">1</td><td>User is on add inspection info screen </td><td>On inspection info screen site map location should display with conveyor name along with head and tail position</td></tr><tr><td width="5">2</td><td>Add item in event </td><td>User should able to add item </td></tr><tr><td width="5">3</td><td>Look for map load in item screen</td><td>Conveyor location should display not user current location as location service is off </td></tr><tr><td width="5">4</td><td>Click on map section</td><td>Map should open in full screen mode </td></tr><tr><td width="5">5</td><td>Look for direction indicator </td><td>No Direction indicator should display in full screen mode </td></tr><tr><td width="5">6</td><td>Save the item</td><td>User should able to save the item </td></tr><tr><td width="20%" valign="top"><span class="label">Execution type:</span></td><td colspan="3">Manual</td></tr>
<tr><td width="20%" valign="top"><span class="label">Estimated exec. duration (min):</span></td><td colspan="3"></td></tr>
