<h2 class='doclevel'>1.6.Test Suite : Total Conveyance Template</h2>
<a name="toc_tc88973"></a><p>&nbsp;</p><div> <table class="tc" width="90%" ><tr><th colspan="4">Test Case CTCP-4793: Verify Add inspection flow for Total Conveyance inspection&nbsp;<span style="font-size: 80%;">[Version  : 1]</span></th></tr>
<tr><td width="20%" valign="top"><span class="label">Author:</span></td><td colspan="3">uig84184</td></tr>
<tr><td colspan="4"><span class="label">Summary:</span><br />Verify Add inspection flow for Total Conveyance inspection </td></tr><tr><td colspan="4"><span class="label">Preconditions:</span><br />User is on inspection list page 
-Site S1 having conveyor C1 already exist & S1 belongs to Total Conveyance Corporate  </td></tr><tr><td><span class="label">#:</span></td><td><span class="label">Step actions:</span></td><td><span class="label">Expected Results:</span></td></tr><tr><td width="5">1</td><td>Click on + button</td><td>User land to New inspection event page </td></tr><tr><td width="5">2</td><td>Select site name as S1 from Site dropdown</td><td>User should able to select Site S1 from the list & Site field should be mandatory field</td></tr><tr><td width="5">3</td><td>Look for conveyor name field </td><td>Only conveyors linked to selected site should display(Mandatory field)</td></tr><tr><td width="5">4</td><td>Look for inspection template field </td><td>TOTAL CONVEYANCE should be displayed as template name </td></tr><tr><td width="5">5</td><td>Look for inspection date field </td><td>It should be the date on which the inspection event is created </td></tr><tr><td width="5">6</td><td>Look for inspector name field</td><td>Inspector name should be displayed as the user with which account is logged in </td></tr><tr><td width="5">7</td><td>Look for Inspection name field</td><td>Inspection name field should be combination of Current date and Site name(Name should be mandatory field)</td></tr><tr><td width="5">8</td><td>Look for the productivity field</td><td>Productivity value should be user input field & it should accept numeric values only  </td></tr><tr><td width="5">9</td><td>Look for Uptime field </td><td>Uptime value should be user input field & it should accept numeric values only  </td></tr><tr><td width="5">10</td><td>Look for location displays in site map </td><td>Site location should be displayed in site map </td></tr><tr><td width="5">11</td><td>Look for back button displayed in header </td><td>On click :
Waring pop-up should display- Are you sure you want to leave inspection without saving with Yes and No button 
If user click on No - User remains on same page 
If user click on Yes  - Inspection event should create without inspection item as its not added, Also event should display in listing screen
</td></tr><tr><td width="20%" valign="top"><span class="label">Execution type:</span></td><td colspan="3">Manual</td></tr>
<tr><td width="20%" valign="top"><span class="label">Estimated exec. duration (min):</span></td><td colspan="3"></td></tr>
<tr><td width="20%" valign="top"><span class="label">Importance:</span></td><td colspan="3">High</td></tr>
<tr><td colspan="4"></td></tr><tr><td > Automation Status:</td><td  colspan = "3" ></td></tr>
<tr><td > Notes:</td><td  colspan = "3" ></td></tr>
<tr><td > Review Comments:</td><td  colspan = "3" ></td></tr>
<tr><td width="20%" valign="top"><span class="label">Requirements</span><td colspan="3">&nbsp;None<br /></td></tr>
<tr><td width="20%" valign="top"><span class="label">Keywords:</span></td><td colspan="3">&nbsp;None<br/></td></tr>
</table>
</div>
