<a name="toc_tc88990"></a><p>&nbsp;</p><div> <table class="tc" width="90%" ><tr><th colspan="4">Test Case CTCP-4795: Verify the sequence logic for Asset Tail in Add inspection pop-up&nbsp;<span style="font-size: 80%;">[Version  : 1]</span></th></tr>
<tr><td width="20%" valign="top"><span class="label">Author:</span></td><td colspan="3">uig84184</td></tr>
<tr><td colspan="4"><span class="label">Summary:</span><br />Verify the sequence logic for Asset Tail in Add inspection pop-up</td></tr><tr><td colspan="4"><span class="label">Preconditions:</span><br />User is on total convenance Event details page </td></tr><tr><td><span class="label">#:</span></td><td><span class="label">Step actions:</span></td><td><span class="label">Expected Results:</span></td></tr><tr><td width="5">1</td><td>Click on + button on item list table </td><td>Add inspection item should display </td></tr><tr><td width="5">2</td><td>Look for items displayed under Tail </td><td>Following items should display : 
 Tail Pulley
Material Spillage / Carryback
Load Zone
Auxillary Equipment
Transitions
Belt Alignment / Pipe Formation
</td></tr><tr><td width="5">3</td><td>Verify condition and legends display for Tail pulley</td><td>Tail Pulley with condition & legends -
Critical -Missing lagging
Fault - Worn lagging
Good - No problems</td></tr><tr><td width="5">4</td><td>Verify condition and legends display for Material Spillage / Carryback</td><td>Critical - Spillage touches belt or rolling components
Fault - Excessive spillage, not touching
Good - No problems</td></tr><tr><td width="5">5</td><td>Verify condition and legends display for  Load Zone</td><td>Critical - Skirtboard missing or damaging belt, impact bed broken, chute damaged
Fault - Poor skirtboard condition, poor condition impact bed
Good</td></tr><tr><td width="5">6</td><td>Verify condition and legends display for Auxillary Equipment</td><td>Critical - Plow missing, Plow contacting belt
Fault - Plow not adjusted correctly
Good</td></tr><tr><td width="5">7</td><td>Verify condition and legends display for Transitions	</td><td>Critical - transition idlers missing
Fault - Transition idlers in poor condition
Good</td></tr><tr><td width="5">8</td><td>Verify condition and legends display for Belt Alignment / Pipe Formation	</td><td>Critical - Belt contacting structure, pipe overlap switching
Fault - Poor pipe formation
Good </td></tr><tr><td width="20%" valign="top"><span class="label">Execution type:</span></td><td colspan="3">Manual</td></tr>
<tr><td width="20%" valign="top"><span class="label">Estimated exec. duration (min):</span></td><td colspan="3"></td></tr>
<tr><td width="20%" valign="top"><span class="label">Importance:</span></td><td colspan="3">High</td></tr>
