<a name="toc_tc89000"></a><p>&nbsp;</p><div> <table class="tc" width="90%" ><tr><th colspan="4">Test Case CTCP-4796: Verify the sequence logic for Asset Center in Add inspection pop-up&nbsp;<span style="font-size: 80%;">[Version  : 1]</span></th></tr>
<tr><td width="20%" valign="top"><span class="label">Author:</span></td><td colspan="3">uig84184</td></tr>
<tr><td colspan="4"><span class="label">Summary:</span><br />Verify the sequence logic for Asset Center in Add inspection pop-up</td></tr><tr><td colspan="4"><span class="label">Preconditions:</span><br />User is on total convenance Event details page </td></tr><tr><td><span class="label">#:</span></td><td><span class="label">Step actions:</span></td><td><span class="label">Expected Results:</span></td></tr><tr><td width="5">1</td><td>Click on + button on item list table </td><td>Add inspection item should display </td></tr><tr><td width="5">2</td><td>Look for items displayed under Centre  </td><td>Following items should display : 
Carry Idlers	
Conveyor Structure		
Material Spillage / Carryback Transitions
Belt Alignment / Pipe Formation	
Guards / E-Stops	
</td></tr><tr><td width="5">3</td><td>Verify condition and legends display for Return Idlers</td><td>Critical - Broken or frozen idlers
Fault - Idlers with vibration, heat, or noise
Good </td></tr><tr><td width="5">4</td><td>Verify condition and legends display for Material Spillage / Carryback</td><td>Critical - Broken or frozen idlers
Fault - Idlers with vibration, heat, or noise
Good </td></tr><tr><td width="5">5</td><td>Verify condition and legends display for  Conveyor Structure	</td><td>Critical - Structure damage w/ potential impact to belt or safety
Fault- Structure damage, not impacting belt
Good</td></tr><tr><td width="5">6</td><td>Verify condition and legends display for Material Spillage / Carryback</td><td>Critical - Spillage touches belt or rolling components
Fault - Excessive spillage, not touching
Good - No problems</td></tr><tr><td width="5">7</td><td>Verify condition and legends display for Belt Alignment / Pipe Formation	</td><td>Critical - Belt contacting structure, pipe overlap switching
Fault - Poor pipe formation
Good</td></tr><tr><td width="5">8</td><td>Verify condition and legends display for Guards / E-Stops	</td><td>Critical - Guards missing or e-stop non functional
Fault - Guards damaged or improperly installed
Good </td></tr><tr><td width="20%" valign="top"><span class="label">Execution type:</span></td><td colspan="3">Manual</td></tr>
<tr><td width="20%" valign="top"><span class="label">Estimated exec. duration (min):</span></td><td colspan="3"></td></tr>
<tr><td width="20%" valign="top"><span class="label">Importance:</span></td><td colspan="3">High</td></tr>
