<a name="toc_tc89029"></a><p>&nbsp;</p><div> <table class="tc" width="90%" ><tr><th colspan="4">Test Case CTCP-4799: Verify Three functionality on event list page&nbsp;<span style="font-size: 80%;">[Version  : 1]</span></th></tr>
<tr><td width="20%" valign="top"><span class="label">Author:</span></td><td colspan="3">uig84184</td></tr>
<tr><td colspan="4"><span class="label">Summary:</span><br />Verify Three functionality on event list page</td></tr><tr><td colspan="4"><span class="label">Preconditions:</span><br />User is on total convenance  event list page</td></tr><tr><td><span class="label">#:</span></td><td><span class="label">Step actions:</span></td><td><span class="label">Expected Results:</span></td></tr><tr><td width="5">1</td><td>Click on expand card </td><td>Event list should expand</td></tr><tr><td width="5">2</td><td>Select item from the list</td><td>User should able to select the item </td></tr><tr><td width="5">3</td><td>Click on three dot</td><td>ON click Action button :
