Item1.1 -To be completed, Good 
Item1.2 -To be completed, Critical 
Item1.3 -To be completed, Fault 
Item1.4 -To be completed, Fault </td></tr><tr><td><span class="label">#:</span></td><td><span class="label">Step actions:</span></td><td><span class="label">Expected Results:</span></td></tr><tr><td width="5">1</td><td>Based on precondition data download inspection Multi inspect </td><td>User should able to download the inspection event </td></tr><tr><td width="5">2</td><td>Look for the file name of the pdf report</td><td>The pdf report should generate with name :
Inspection date(2025-01-21-)+Sitename(testVMCSIte@9)+Inspection event name(Multiple-21. Jan, 2025 testVMCSIte@9) egg :2025-01-21-testVMCSIte@9-Multiple-21. Jan, 2025 testVMCSIte@9</td></tr><tr><td width="5">3</td><td>Look for heading displayed on the top of pdf report</td><td>The pdf report should display inspection event name : 21. Jan, 2025 testVMCSIte@9</td></tr><tr><td width="5">4</td><td>Look for generated date </td><td>Generated date should display the date PDF report is generated egg :Generated Date: Jan 23, 2025</td></tr><tr><td width="5">5</td><td>Look for generated by</td><td>Generated by should display the name of user who downloaded the report</td></tr><tr><td width="5">6</td><td>Look for inspection table </td><td>Inspection table should display :
-Inspection date, Site & Inspector in data</td></tr><tr><td width="5">7</td><td>Look for data displayed in overview graph </td><td>The overview graph should display : Total, Critical, Fault & Good card with respective item count
